 "text": "Treasurer\nPress Alt+1 for screen-reader mode, Alt+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window\nHome\nDepartments Assessor\nAuditor\nClerk Of Court\nConservation\nCounty Attorney\nCustodian\nDriver's License\nEmergency Management\nEngineer\nEnvironmental Health\nGeneral Relief\nIT / GIS Department\nLandfill / Convenience Center\nPublic Health\nRecorder\nSafety Coordinator\nSheriff\nSocial Services\nSupervisors\nTreasurer\nVeteran Affairs\nZoning\nGIS Mapping Mapping\nProperty Search\nCemetery Search\nCommunity Links\nEvents\nContact Info\nFAQ's\nLogin\nTreasurer's Office\nProperty Search\nOnline Mapping\nIowa Land Records\nHistorical Photos\nBoard of Supervisors Agenda\nPay Court Fees Online\nPay Property Taxes Online\nRenew Vehicle Licenses Online\nDrivers License Appointments\nGrundy County Historical Documents\nWelcome to the Grundy County Treasurer's Office\nTax Dept.: 319-824-3108\nAuto Dept.: 319-824-3132\nDriver's License Dept.: 319-824-1212 ext 1\n706 G Avenue\nGrundy Center IA 50638\nLori K. Kruse, County Treasurer grundycotreas@grundycountyiowa.gov\nTax & Auto Departments - Mon - Fri, 8:00 - 4:30\nDriver's License Department - by appointment only\nWritten Driver's License Test - by appointment only\nDrive Tests - by appointment only\nTreasurer About Property Tax\nDriver License Forms and Manuals\nDrivers License Appointments\nForms and Links\nGrundy County GIS\nMotor Vehicle Forms\nMotor Vehicle Renewal Registration Payment Options\nProperty Tax Payment Options\nRecycler / Junk Vehicle\nTax Rate Info FY26-27 (Levy Sheet)\nTax Sale Publication List\nTax Sale Rules\nFAQ's\nRelated Links IDOT - Motor Vehicle Division\nIDOT - Office of Driver Services\nGeneral Information\nTreasurer's Responsibilities include\nThe issuance of vehicle titles and registrations and the collection of all vehicle fees for residents of Grundy County. Annually we process thousands of vehicle transactions, respond to many telephone inquiries, provide service to walk-in customers to the office, collect over 3.5 million dollars.\nThe issuance or renewal for the Iowa Department of Transportation of over 5000 driver’s licenses. Administering driving and written tests, including Commercial testing, and Department of Transportation re-examinations as needed.\nThe collection of property taxes for over 12,000 parcels, all mobile home tax, all special assessments by the numerous taxing entities and other miscellaneous tax parcels totaling more than $16,000,000. We respond to many tax inquiries each year from property owners, financial institutions, real estate agents, abstractors and appraisers. The administer of the Iowa Property Tax Credit Program and conduct the annual tax sale for the collection of delinquent taxes.\nThe receipting and recording of all funds collected by the various county departments.\nThe financial administration and services for banking, cash management and investments. Distribution of collections to schools, cities and all other taxing agencies\nFacebook\nX\nDepartments\nAuditor\nTreasurer\nSheriff\nEngineer\nConservation\nBoard of Supervisors\nRecorder\nQuick Links\nProperty Search\nGIS Mapping\nPay Property Taxes\nPay Court Fees\nRenew Vechicle License\nIowa Land Records\nFAQ's\nOffice Hours: 8:00 AM TO 4:30 PM MONDAY THRU FRIDAY\nAddress: 706 G AVE, GRUNDY CENTER, IOWA 50638\nCourthouse\nOffice Hours: 8:00 AM TO 4:30 PM MONDAY THRU FRIDAY\nAddress: 706 H AVE SUITE 2, GRUNDY CENTER, IOWA 50638\nPublic Health\nOffice Hours: 7:00 AM TO 3:30 PM MONDAY THRU FRIDAY\nAddress: 22580 M AVE / PO BOX 127 GRUNDY CENTER, IOWA 50638\nEngineer's Office\nOffice Hours: 8:00 AM TO 4:00 PM MONDAY THRU FRIDAY\nAddress: 705 8TH ST., GRUNDY CENTER, IOWA 50638\nSheriff's Office\nOffice Hours: 8:00 AM TO 4:30 PM MONDAY THRU FRIDAY\nAddress: 204 4TH ST., MORRISON, IOWA 50657\nConservation Office\n©2026 Grundy County All rights reserved\nDeveloped by 'corePHP' LLC\nHome\nDepartments\nAssessor\nAuditor\nClerk Of Court\nConservation\nCounty Attorney\nCustodian\nDriver's License\nEmergency Management\nEngineer\nEnvironmental Health\nGeneral Relief\nIT / GIS Department\nLandfill / Convenience Center\nPublic Health\nRecorder\nSafety Coordinator\nSheriff\nSocial Services\nSupervisors\nTreasurer\nVeteran Affairs\nZoning\nGIS Mapping\nMapping\nProperty Search\nCemetery Search\nCommunity Links\nEvents\nContact Info\nFAQ's\nLogin",
